      "solution": "Divide top and bottom by their common factor 6:\n\n$$\\frac{12}{18} = \\frac{12\\div 6}{18\\div 6} = \\frac{2}{3}$$\n\nThe other options are either equivalent but not simplified, or wrong.",
      "equationsUsed": ["\\frac{12}{18} = \\frac{2}{3}"],
